    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Most Realistic Animal Role-Playing Experience</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/056ac25bfa96283831c4a1af2c4c66d3.poster.avif?t=1688877203\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/056ac25bfa96283831c4a1af2c4c66d3.webm?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/056ac25bfa96283831c4a1af2c4c66d3.mp4?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Welcome to The WILDS, a unique journey into the unforgiving wilderness where you take on the lives of iconic animals tasked with just one thing, survival. Learn to stalk through tall grass as a Cougar and ambush your prey. Forage for food and water as a Red Deer while staying vigilant for ferocious predators that are lurking in the depths of the forest for a meal of their own. Take on the challenges of life in the wild and establish your place in the hierarchy of the Animal Kingdom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build A Pack And Raise A Family</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/aa6f75ecbd9e236358ebb4c54d009c10.poster.avif?t=1688877203\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/aa6f75ecbd9e236358ebb4c54d009c10.webm?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/aa6f75ecbd9e236358ebb4c54d009c10.mp4?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The wilderness can be harsh but you won't have to face the world alone. Form and maintain strong bonds with other wild animals to create your own pack. Claim secluded dens where your new family can make a home to rest, socialize, and even breed babies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ever Expanding Roster Of Animals</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/e3ffb5221633afb21288362a60e27116.poster.avif?t=1688877203\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/e3ffb5221633afb21288362a60e27116.webm?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/e3ffb5221633afb21288362a60e27116.mp4?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Ten playable animals already added including the Wolf, Deer, Bear, Raven, Raccoon, Cougar, Boar, Fox, Moose, and the brand new Eagle! This roster will continue to expand as we get more and more of the core gameplay implemented.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Customization And Rewarding Progression</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/d4930cb69f59c200c5640e06e9fe3dbd.poster.avif?t=1688877203\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/d4930cb69f59c200c5640e06e9fe3dbd.webm?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/d4930cb69f59c200c5640e06e9fe3dbd.mp4?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create your perfect animals with dozens of customizable physical features, personality traits, and abilities! Everything about your animal will contribute to their various strengths and weaknesses as they strive to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Time, Seasons, and Weather</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/049572c7fcecfc906c4ee4c27b162df0.poster.avif?t=1688877203\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/049572c7fcecfc906c4ee4c27b162df0.webm?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/049572c7fcecfc906c4ee4c27b162df0.mp4?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Gorgeous sunsets over crystal clear lakes, moonbeams glowing down through towering pines, and snow covered peaks during harsh winter storms. The world around you will change dynamically through the year bringing brand new experiences each new day!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Dedication To Detail</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/75281e63b080a38328147e8e7c396b6b.poster.avif?t=1688877203\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/75281e63b080a38328147e8e7c396b6b.webm?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028590/extras/75281e63b080a38328147e8e7c396b6b.mp4?t=1688877203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The goal is ultimate immersion for you to live your life as an animal. Grass bends under your foot, dirt is kicked up by your stomping hoof, a cold puff of fog from your panting wolf in winter. No detail will be ignored.<br><br><br>The WILDS is constantly growing and evolving with community feedback in the Discord and Discussions page so feel free to join us if you have a vision for the game you'd like to share.",
